   "value": "test18 = EffectiveBracket[SF1, SF2, SF3];\n(* Check that the result contains BracketHold, ProjectorHold, and ProjectorBarHold *)\ntest18HasBracket = Not[FreeQ[test18, Private`BracketHold]];\ntest18HasProjector = Not[FreeQ[test18, Private`ProjectorHold]];\ntest18HasProjectorBar = Not[FreeQ[test18, Private`ProjectorBarHold]];\ntest18Result = test18HasBracket && test18HasProjector && test18HasProjectorBar;\nPrint[\"Test 18 (has BracketHold, ProjectorHold, ProjectorBarHold): \", If[test18Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest18Result",
